{title: Raat Ke Humsafar}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Asha Bhosle Shankar Jaikishan}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] [Bb] [Cm] [Fm],        Raat ke humsafar, thak ke ghar ko chale
[Bb] [Eb] [G] [Cm],        Joomti aa rahi, hai subah pyaar ki
[Cm] [Bb] [Cm] [Fm],        Dekh kar samne roop ki roshni
[Bb] [Eb] [G] [Cm],        Phir looti ja rahi, hai subah pyaar ki
[Fm] [Db] [Bb] [Cm],        Sonewalon ko hutkar jagaana bhi hai
[Fm] [Db] [Bb] [Cm],        Raat ke jagaton ko sulana bhi hai
[Cm] [Ab] [Eb] [Cm],        Deti hai jaagne ki sada saath hi
[Cm] [Bb] [Ab] [Cm],        Loriyan ga rahi hain, subah pyaar ki
[Cm] [Bb],        Raat ke humsafar...
[Fm] [Db] [Bb] [Cm],        Raat ne pyaar ke jam bhar kar diye
[Fm] [Db] [Bb] [Cm],        Ankhon ankhon se jo maine tumne piye
[Cm] [Ab] [Eb] [Cm],        Hosh to ab talak jaake laute nahin
[Cm] [Bb] [Ab] [Cm],        Aur kya la rahi hai, subah pyaar ki
[Cm] [Bb],        Raat ke humsafar...
[Fm] [Db] [Bb] [Cm],        Kya kya wade huye, kis ne khayi kasam
[Fm] [Db] [Bb] [Cm],        Is nayi raah par, humne rakhe kadam
[Cm] [Ab] [Eb] [Cm],        Chup saka pyaar kab hum chupaye to kya
[Cm] [Bb] [Ab] [Cm],        Sab samaj pa rahi hain, subah pyaar ki
[Cm] [Bb],        Raat ke humsafar...
